  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><h3 data-start=\"122\" data-end=\"147\" id=\"isPasted\">• Brand Introduction:</h3><p data-start=\"148\" data-end=\"523\"><strong data-start=\"148\" data-end=\"159\">BOO WHO</strong> is a fresh, youth-driven brand focused on creating high-energy, high-laugh games that bring students together. With an eye for bold design and social connection, our mission is to break the ice, spark competition, and keep the vibes fun, especially on campus. Our flagship release, <strong data-start=\"442\" data-end=\"449\">BOO</strong>, is designed with students in mind — simple to pick up, hard to put down.</p><hr data-start=\"525\" data-end=\"528\"><h3 data-start=\"530\" data-end=\"556\">• Product Description:</h3><p data-start=\"557\" data-end=\"913\"><strong data-start=\"557\" data-end=\"564\">BOO</strong> is a fast-paced bluffing game built for students who love a little mischief. Players take on secret ghost identities, trying to outwit each other in a spooky, social showdown. It’s made for dorms, student unions, campus clubs, or late-night hangouts. With 2-4 players, 20–30 minutes game time, and super easy setup, BOO brings hype without the hassle.</p><hr data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"918\"><h3 data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"953\">• USP (Unique Selling Point):</h3><ul data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"1322\"><li data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"1024\"><p data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"1024\">👻 Built specifically for students — fun, quick, and highly social</p></li><li data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1101\"><p data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1101\">🎒 Great for dorm life, orientation events, or chill nights with friends</p></li><li data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1185\"><p data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1185\">💬 Encourages communication, bluffing, and banter — ideal for new friend groups</p></li><li data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1246\"><p data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1246\">🌈 Eye-catching, modern design that resonates with Gen Z</p></li><li data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1322\"><p data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1322\">💡 Easy to learn, endlessly replayable, and perfect for tight schedules</p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1327\"><h3 data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1349\">• Payment Terms:</h3><p data-start=\"1350\" data-end=\"1563\">Affiliates earn a <strong data-start=\"1368\" data-end=\"1404\">10%</strong> commission per sale through their unique referral link. Payouts are made <strong data-start=\"1478\" data-end=\"1509\">monthly via bank transfers</strong>, with a <strong>AED 10</strong> threshold.</p><hr data-start=\"1565\" data-end=\"1568\"><h3 data-start=\"1570\" data-end=\"1594\">• Other Information:</h3><ul data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1931\"><li data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1693\"><p data-start=\"1597\" data-end=\"1693\">BOO WHO provides affiliates with promo materials, social media content, and seasonal campaigns</p></li><li data-start=\"1694\" data-end=\"1774\"><p data-start=\"1696\" data-end=\"1774\">Strong performance on TikTok and Instagram, especially with student creators</p></li><li data-start=\"1775\" data-end=\"1850\"><p data-start=\"1777\" data-end=\"1850\">Opportunities for student ambassadors, giveaways, and affiliate collabs</p></li><li data-start=\"1851\" data-end=\"1931\"><p data-start=\"1853\" data-end=\"1931\">Fast-growing community with rave reviews from college game nights and events</p></li></ul></div></div>",
